  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Aaseya ALPS: One-Stop Licensing for Businesses and Residents",
    "splashDescription": "Licensing and permitting are critical services provided by government agencies to residents and businesses. They play a pivotal role in regulating various activities to ensure public safety, environmental protection, and compliance with regulations. Many processes are manual or rely on legacy systems, highlighting the need for modernization to improve efficiency, scalability and service delivery. Aaseya License and Permitting Solution (ALPS) is a one-stop solution for government services for residents and businesses. This solution can create and manage license applications, payments, and inspections, increasing increase efficiency and revenue within local government.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/475968/overview/img690215169889773480.png?b58f90f4515bd159cd0ba8ec8dd1665e",
